roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":3272250890,"text":"もしかして…俺様の急激な成長に驚いてんのか！？","nextNodeIds":[715280108]},{"nodeId":715280108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":1706398626,"text":"照れんじゃねえか！ガーハッハッハッ！そう俺様を褒めるなって、グゥオパァー兄貴！兄貴は手を抜いてくれたんだろ？あんな平凡な装置を使って…","nextNodeIds":[715280109]},{"nodeId":715280109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1030,"speakerName":"煙緋","textMapHash":3502631042,"text":"どうやら、グゥオパァーの準備運動が終わったようだ。次は「花羽葉月神機」の最大限の力を発揮しよう。","nextNodeIds":[715280110]},{"nodeId":715280110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":2625306346,"text":"グゥオパァー、この前決めた通り、「園芸装置」の出力を千分の一から百分の一に調整しよう？","nextNodeIds":[715280111]},{"nodeId":715280111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":712428386,"text":"これ以上にすると、一斗さんのオニカブトムシが怪我しちゃうかもしれないからね。","nextNodeIds":[715280112]},{"nodeId":715280112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1043,"speakerName":"グゥオパァー","textMapHash":1862262602,"text":"！♪","nextNodeIds":[715280113]},{"nodeId":715280113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2753014794,"text":"そんなこったろうと思ったぜ。","nextNodeIds":[715280114,715280115]},{"nodeId":715280114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2072112642,"text":"ええ！？千分の一！","nextNodeIds":[715280116]},{"nodeId":715280116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30468,"speakerName":"「花角玉将」","textMapHash":356740562,"text":"やはり予想の範疇を超えていたか…","nextNodeIds":[715280117]},{"nodeId":715280117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":3678680114,"text":"おい、待てよ！","nextNodeIds":[715280118]},{"nodeId":715280118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":1486106290,"text":"千分の一？…一、十、百、千…千！？","nextNodeIds":[715280119]},{"nodeId":715280119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":2852231946,"text":"ちょ、ちょっと冗談はやめてくれよ！さっきので、せ、千分の一の力しか出してねぇってのか？","nextNodeIds":[715280120]},{"nodeId":715280120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1043,"speakerName":"グゥオパァー","textMapHash":2110093018,"text":"？♪","nextNodeIds":[715280121]},{"nodeId":715280121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1030,"speakerName":"煙緋","textMapHash":1910869650,"text":"グゥオパァーが不思議に思ってるよ。オニカブトムシを強くして、「水晶島バンバン旋風」を倒すんじゃないのか？","nextNodeIds":[715280122]},{"nodeId":715280122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":1542303642,"text":"ましてや体格の差がはっきりしてるんだし。「花羽葉月神機」は土鍋サイズの石を運ばなきゃいけないから、これくらいの力があって当然だよ。","nextNodeIds":[715280123]},{"nodeId":715280123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":616025602,"text":"グゥオパァーやアタシどころか…一斗さんよりも体の大きい「水晶島バンバン旋風」は言うまでもないでしょ！","nextNodeIds":[715280124]},{"nodeId":715280124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":2763709970,"text":"ありえねぇ…さっきの倍強い相手ならまだしも、十倍…勝つまでに何回負けるかとか、そんな話じゃなくなってくるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[715280125]},{"nodeId":715280125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":650640210,"text":"千倍なんて…もっとありえねぇよ！","nextNodeIds":[715280126]},{"nodeId":715280126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":172456378,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[715280127]},{"nodeId":715280127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3025936434,"text":"「一つの戦術がうまくいかなかったら、考え方を変えるべきだ。オイラと旅人が旅をしてるときは、柔軟に考えてるぞ！」","nextNodeIds":[715280128]},{"nodeId":715280128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2728163234,"text":"「一つの方法だけ考えてたら、いくらがんばっても解決しない！」","nextNodeIds":[715280129]},{"nodeId":715280129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":4097685210,"text":"…グゥオパァー兄貴、分かったぞ！","nextNodeIds":[715280130]},{"nodeId":715280130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":1210302178,"text":"俺様は機関術を学ぶ！「赤紅一杵」に装甲を作ってやり、限界を突破させるんだ！","nextNodeIds":[715280131]},{"nodeId":715280131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":1328617074,"text":"それか…「赤紅一杵」が操縦する、もっと大きなメカオニカブトムシを作って、俺様が「赤紅一杵」を指揮し操縦させる！","nextNodeIds":[715280132]},{"nodeId":715280132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1043,"speakerName":"グゥオパァー","textMapHash":101464634,"text":"！？","nextNodeIds":[715280133]},{"nodeId":715280133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2597373826,"text":"オニカブトムシがメカオニカブトムシを操縦…そんなことほんとにできんのかよ？しかもそれ、虫相撲って言えるのか？","nextNodeIds":[715280134,715280135]},{"nodeId":715280134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3603724970,"text":"想像できることは、実現できる！","nextNodeIds":[715280136]},{"nodeId":715280136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":443952394,"text":"「花羽葉月神機」の実力を目の当たりにして気付いたんだ…オニカブトムシの力には限界があるってことを！","nextNodeIds":[715280137]},{"nodeId":715280137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":4094206354,"text":"忍と玉将…そして特に「空を翔ける白鉄チビ助」、みんなが教えてくれた！負けを認めるのは癪だが、自分から変わろうとしないほど、馬鹿じゃねえ！","nextNodeIds":[715280138]},{"nodeId":715280138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":4086125626,"text":"グゥオパァー兄貴は俺様に新たな道を示してくれた——機関術でオニカブトムシを強化するという道を！","nextNodeIds":[715280139]},{"nodeId":715280139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":3573327762,"text":"これで、どれだけ体格に差があろうとも、俺様のオニカブトムシは、あの「水晶島バンバン旋風」に負けないはずだ！","nextNodeIds":[715280140]},{"nodeId":715280140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1043,"speakerName":"グゥオパァー","textMapHash":1749575138,"text":"？♪♪","nextNodeIds":[715280141]},{"nodeId":715280141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1030,"speakerName":"煙緋","textMapHash":307062130,"text":"うーん、グゥオパァーは全然分かっていないようだが？","nextNodeIds":[715280142]},{"nodeId":715280142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":620452794,"text":"機関術みたいなのは、師匠に頼んであの方に聞いてみないと。引き受けてくれるかどうか…","nextNodeIds":[715280143]},{"nodeId":715280143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":2015088490,"text":"兄貴、姉御、大恩人！ぜひ紹介してくれ…！","nextNodeIds":[715280144]},{"nodeId":715280144,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1049,"speakerName":"久岐忍","textMapHash":843096498,"text":"ん？","nextNodeIds":[715280145]},{"nodeId":715280145,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1049,"speakerName":"久岐忍","textMapHash":3200813778,"text":"親分…あんたも璃月に留学したいのか？","nextNodeIds":[715280146]},{"nodeId":715280146,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":1927054890,"text":"忍！もう来たのかよ！？","nextNodeIds":[715280147]},{"nodeId":715280147,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1049,"speakerName":"久岐忍","textMapHash":1750836922,"text":"約束の時間だ。港に向かわないと、最後のモラで買った帰りの船も無駄になってしまう。","nextNodeIds":[715280148]},{"nodeId":715280148,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":4059437842,"text":"まままま、待て！こっちはまだ重要なことを相談しているところなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[715280149]},{"nodeId":715280149,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1049,"speakerName":"久岐忍","textMapHash":950710370,"text":"全部聞いていたよ。","nextNodeIds":[715280150]},{"nodeId":715280150,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1049,"speakerName":"久岐忍","textMapHash":796116234,"text":"親分が何かを「学ぶ」と言い出したのは、喜ばしいことだ。学び方なら、参考書を一冊書いてやってもいい。","nextNodeIds":[715280151]},{"nodeId":715280151,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1049,"speakerName":"久岐忍","textMapHash":1859027378,"text":"…残念だが、璃月に留学するには資金が必要だ、荒瀧派が普段使う出費の数倍のな。留学の費用に当てはあるのか？","nextNodeIds":[715280152]},{"nodeId":715280152,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":3439626898,"text":"た、たたたた、大したことじゃねぇだろ…稲妻に帰ったら、しばらくはちゃんと働く！","nextNodeIds":[715280153]},{"nodeId":715280153,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":2849477154,"text":"働いてモラを稼ぐのは初めてじゃねぇ！さっきああいうことを言った以上、もちろん覚悟は出来てる！少し本気を出せば、いくらでも稼げんだろ！","nextNodeIds":[715280154]},{"nodeId":715280154,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":3333634794,"text":"それに、お前や荒瀧派のみんなを放ったらかしにするわけじゃねぇよ。勉強のために独りで遠くに行くなんて、どんな親分だ？","nextNodeIds":[715280155]},{"nodeId":715280155,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":4167654290,"text":"学ぶならみんなで一緒にだ！全員分の学費を集めて、荒瀧派で留学して…強くなって！そうしたら俺らは「天下無敵の荒瀧派」だ！","nextNodeIds":[715280156]},{"nodeId":715280156,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1049,"speakerName":"久岐忍","textMapHash":4069426330,"text":"親分…いつからそんな台詞が言えるようになったんだ？","nextNodeIds":[715280157]},{"nodeId":715280157,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1387731346,"text":"いいじゃんか！牛使い{RUBY#[S]「真剣虫相撲大鬼王」}野郎がそんな壮大なことを話すなんて珍しいぞ、有言実行しろよ！","nextNodeIds":[715280158,715280159]},{"nodeId":715280158,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1571822778,"text":"漢たる者、有言実行！","nextNodeIds":[715280160]},{"nodeId":715280160,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":4228203378,"text":"まぁ…具体的にどんな仕事をするのか、一日にどのくらい稼がなきゃならねぇのか、ちゃんと計算してねぇけど…","nextNodeIds":[715280161]},{"nodeId":715280161,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30468,"speakerName":"「花角玉将」","textMapHash":482347850,"text":"そういうことなら、俺が璃月に残ろう。料理人の姉さんに付いていき、機関術についてじっくり学ぶ。","nextNodeIds":[715280162]},{"nodeId":715280162,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30468,"speakerName":"「花角玉将」","textMapHash":3299021306,"text":"あとは、今さっき「荒瀧煌々虫相撲大修行」が告知されたから、さらに沢山の虫相撲の強者やオニカブトムシに役立つ食べ物を調査できる。","nextNodeIds":[715280163]},{"nodeId":715280163,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30468,"speakerName":"「花角玉将」","textMapHash":1922512058,"text":"もし「鬼王の右腕」殿下と「空を翔ける白鉄チビ助」様が、まだ虫相撲がやりたい、または練習したいなら、ここで遊んでやってもいい。","nextNodeIds":[715280164]},{"nodeId":715280164,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":3133735346,"text":"おお！それはいい案だな、玉将！","nextNodeIds":[715280165]},{"nodeId":715280165,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":3384107882,"text":"んじゃ、いつも通り、お前のじいさんに心配しないよう伝えておくぜ。","nextNodeIds":[715280166]},{"nodeId":715280166,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":2620194338,"text":"次にお前らに会うときには、どんな驚きをくれるんだろうな！楽しみだ！","nextNodeIds":[715280167]},{"nodeId":715280167,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","textMapHash":1914891154,"text":"先に言っとくけど、あの仙人が教えてくれるって保証はアタシもできないからね…煙緋とできる限りやってみて、あとは縁に任せるしかない！","nextNodeIds":[715280168]},{"nodeId":715280168,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30468,"speakerName":"「花角玉将」","textMapHash":3085314786,"text":"そのお方がそれほど凄い技量を持っているのなら、どんなに傲慢でも構わない！大切なのは、俺も鬼王や荒瀧派のために誠意を示すこと…","nextNodeIds":[715280169]},{"nodeId":715280169,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30468,"speakerName":"「花角玉将」","textMapHash":4205776858,"text":"だから、どんな贈り物を渡せばこの「花羽葉月神機」を作れるほどの高い技術に見合うのか、ちゃんと調査しないと。","nextNodeIds":[715280170]},{"nodeId":715280170,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1049,"speakerName":"久岐忍","textMapHash":862471418,"text":"これ以上遅れると間に合わないよ、親分。","nextNodeIds":[715280171]},{"nodeId":715280171,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":2717841226,"text":"はぁ…仕方ねぇ！","nextNodeIds":[715280172]},{"nodeId":715280172,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1049,"speakerName":"久岐忍","textMapHash":986722234,"text":"旅人、パイモン、煙緋先輩に、香菱さんとグゥオパァーさん…親分が開いたこの虫相撲大会に付き合ってくれて、本当にありがとう…","nextNodeIds":[715280173]},{"nodeId":715280173,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1049,"speakerName":"久岐忍","textMapHash":4055433242,"text":"謝礼を受け取ってくれ。これからの旅に役立つといいんだが。","nextNodeIds":[715280174]},{"nodeId":715280174,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2997405082,"text":"わぁ！本当にプレゼントを用意してくれたのか、優しいな！","nextNodeIds":[715280175,715280176]},{"nodeId":715280175,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3069207378,"text":"うれしい！","nextNodeIds":[715280177]},{"nodeId":715280177,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":3199158474,"text":"別れのときだ！ダチ公、「空を翔ける白鉄チビ助」、グゥオパァー兄貴、料理人の姉御と大恩人！","nextNodeIds":[715280178]},{"nodeId":715280178,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","textMapHash":1911953378,"text":"すぐに！また会おうぜ！","nextNodeIds":[715280179]},{"nodeId":715280179,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1043,"speakerName":"グゥオパァー","textMapHash":1061911090,"text":"~♪♫♩♪♬","nextNodeIds":[715280180]},{"nodeId":715280180,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1527695882,"text":"そう言うと思ってたぜ、牛使い{RUBY#[S]「真剣虫相撲大鬼王」}野郎！","nextNodeIds":[715280181]},{"nodeId":715280181,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2132560338,"text":"志があるのはいいことだけどさ、焦っちゃだめだよな！やっぱり忍の意見をちゃんと聞いて、現状を考えて、適度に休んだりしないと！","nextNodeIds":[715280182]},{"nodeId":715280182,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1972861354,"text":"もちろん、次会うときはオニカブトムシが操縦する超~おっきいメカオニカブトムシが作れるといいな！","nextNodeIds":[715280183]},{"nodeId":715280183,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13852,"speakerName":"「水晶島バンバン旋風」","textMapHash":931459826,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[715280184]},{"nodeId":715280184,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13852,"speakerName":"「水晶島バンバン旋風」","textMapHash":3011337066,"text":"？","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":715280176,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1449138418,"text":"持ちつ持たれつ、だね！","nextNodeIds":[715280177]},{"nodeId":715280159,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3327784058,"text":"人に頼らず自分で解決！","nextNodeIds":[715280160]},{"nodeId":715280135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3977159018,"text":"一斗を超信じる！","nextNodeIds":[715280136]},{"nodeId":715280115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1111127330,"text":"うわ！勝てるわけがない！","nextNodeIds":[715280116]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7152801,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1044"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7152801,7166660,7166662],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"荒瀧一斗","count":42},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":14},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":10},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1049,"speakerName":"久岐忍","count":10},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30468,"speakerName":"「花角玉将」","count":8},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1043,"speakerName":"グゥオパァー","count":6},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1012,"speakerName":"香菱","count":6},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1030,"speakerName":"煙緋","count":5},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30469,"speakerName":"「超弩級強者の神級随行料理人」","count":3},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30470,"speakerName":"「天地鳴動·超弩級強者」","count":2},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13852,"speakerName":"「水晶島バンバン旋風」","count":2}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[171528],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":3630935926,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_ACTIVITY","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingF